Z||000006||88 Database Nut||02-24-2000||08:32 AM||||I have bought stuff from David in the past (a year ago or so).  His stuff is exactly as he advertises, and he ships things with good care (lots of styrofoam pellets).  Lately I have heard alot of complaints about people not being able to reach him (like those above) and I think he has something up on his website about that.  This is a sidelight business for him, and I guess maybe he's not able to give it as much attention as he'd like.  Anyway, I've had several good dealings with him, hope you can reach him too.  His prices are very reasonable (that ttop kit is very tempting, despite the extra cost of getting it installed (might be a fun project for your special car)).||||reg||14
